  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">Celsius ⇄ Fahrenheit</p>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n\n  <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n  <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n\n  <p class=\"formulas\">\n    °F = °C × 9/5 + 32<br>\n    °C = (°F − 32) × 5/9\n  </p>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --panel: #29366f;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --light: #f4f4f4;\n  --error: #ef476f;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #22243a 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #22243a 75%),\n                    linear-gradient(45deg, #22243a 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #22243a 75%);\n  background-size: 24px 24px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 12px 12px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--light);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  background: var(--panel);\n  border: 4px solid var(--light);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  margin: -8px 0 0;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--light);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--light);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--light);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  filter: brightness(1.1);\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px dashed var(--light);\n  min-height: 60px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\noutput.error {\n  color: var(--error);\n  border-color: var(--error);\n}\n\n.formulas {\n  margin: 0;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  opacity: 0.75;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 18px; }\n  output { font-size: 22px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var input = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  var direction = document.getElementById('direction');\n  var button = document.getElementById('convert');\n  var output = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert() {\n    var raw = input.value.trim();\n    var value = Number(raw);\n\n    if (raw === '' || !isFinite(value)) {\n      output.textContent = 'Error';\n      output.classList.add('error');\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var result;\n    if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n      result = value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    } else {\n      result = (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    }\n\n    if (!isFinite(result)) {\n      output.textContent = 'Error';\n      output.classList.add('error');\n      return;\n    }\n\n    output.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n    output.classList.remove('error');\n  }\n\n  button.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\n  input.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {\n    if (event.key === 'Enter') {\n      convert();\n    }\n  });\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nAn offline, single-page pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the input field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - **Celsius → Fahrenheit** (`c-to-f`)\n   - **Fahrenheit → Celsius** (`f-to-c`)\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter in the input field).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no unit.\n\nEmpty, invalid, or non-finite input displays `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `°F = °C × 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `°C = (°F − 32) × 5/9`\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fully offline: no network requests, imports, packages, storage, or external assets.\n- Keyboard accessible: all controls are labeled and focusable.\n- Responsive layout works down to 360px wide.\n- Styling uses a cohesive 3–5 color palette with visible hover, focus, and pressed states.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
